       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. COBOLLM.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY ZLCHCTRL.

       LINKAGE SECTION.
       COPY CLIPARM.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING CLI-PARM.
           ADD 1 TO ZF-CALL-COUNT
           MOVE CLI-STATUS TO ZF-STATUS
           MOVE CLI-PLATFORM TO ZF-PLATFORM
           MOVE CLI-ARG-COUNT TO ZF-ARG-COUNT
           MOVE CLI-TASK-LENGTH TO ZF-TASK-LENGTH
           MOVE CLI-TASK TO ZF-TASK
           MOVE ZERO TO CLI-EXIT-CODE
           GOBACK.

       END PROGRAM COBOLLM.
